  "objective": "Attack the fictional Iron Gate military base: destroy every vehicle in Base Command, Base Logistics and Base Armour, then fly Anvil-1 through Egress Gate before the 60-minute limit. Protect Ranger-1. Loss of Anvil-1 or Ranger-1 fails the mission. Air-defence units and scrambled fighters are optional targets.",
