    "coalitionBriefing": {
      "blue": "Anvil: two Hornets, hot Kutaisi departure, four GBU-38, two AIM-120C and two AIM-9X per aircraft. Control/AWACS 251 AM; Texaco probe-and-drogue tanker 253 AM. Base Command is the assigned initial group task; manually prosecute Logistics and Armour next. Dodge flight (F-16C) provides SEAD against the Osa group. Base-perimeter entry by Anvil-1 starts a 60-second hostile scramble delay. Ranger-1 is a friendly command vehicle southwest of the compound; protect it. After all three target groups are destroyed, pass Egress Gate west of the base. No buildings, laser designation, target coordinates in the aircraft avionics or automatic recovery are configured."
